Summary data text field:
Field	Description
SEQ_ID	The NimbleGen sequence identifier. Used to grounp the probe pairs together for determing gene expression summary values.
Control	The gene expression value from the control data file.
Experimental	The gene expression value from the experimental data file.
Fold change	Fold change of the gene expression value from the experimental data file in comparison with that of control data.
Up/Down	The relative gene expression level of the experimental data in comparison with the control data.
p. value	p. value of the t-test
